# The image only copies the output of scripts/build-web.sh, built on the host;
# nothing is compiled in Docker. Send just that output, minus env files.
# 镜像只拷贝在宿主机由 scripts/build-web.sh 构建的产物，Docker 里不编译任何东西。
# 构建上下文只发送这些产物，并排除环境配置文件。
*
!.next/standalone
!.next/static
!public
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.next/standalone/.next/cache
